I have a Cabriolet that gave me sig 11 errors all the time. I had
changed jumpers for cache to reflect the user manual's setting. This
turned out to be the problem. Manual said I could use 12ns, chips were
marked to support it so I changed. Problems came up when compiling. When
I went back to 15ns all was fine.

