Are you sure the memory is true parity?  I've had dealers sell me
memory they claimed was parity when it wasn't.  The number of chips on
the stick should be divisible by 3 if it's parity.  Multias won't run
on anything but true parity.  Look at
http://www.starshipcorp.com/mutiareference.html for more info.  They
have a downloadable pdf version of the multia manual.

