I have an Alpha 21164A, 500 MHz. I installed Linux and I suffered the
same dissappointing slow floating point spec with my C code. I realized
that the problem is not in the os (Linux), or the compiler (gcc), but in
the standard mathematic library libm.a. When I switched to the new cpml
